WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:29.900
Tesla Powerwall supplied over 500 megawatts to California's grid during a heatwave, proving virtual power plant capacity at scale. This is Tesla Shorts Time, episode 601. Residential batteries gripped together through the virtual power plant program sent electricity back into the network. The contribution happened at the height of demand while temperatures stayed extreme. TeslaNorth.com and Basinor both recorded the same output level from the core

